WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Starting a company in Egypt?

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:06.020
Begin with the legal structure that fits your activity and ownership.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:11.800
GAFI's Investor Service Center guide lists incorporation requirements for different company types.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.860
Required documents, approvals, capital rules and fees vary,

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:19.500
so confirm the requirements for your own case before applying.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.580
To explore formation through FoundStart, register for an account

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.120
and review the available scope and requirements.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.680
Confirm government fees and any ongoing obligations separately before paying.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.100
Registration is not company incorporation and does not guarantee approval.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.680
This video is general information, not legal or tax advice.
